  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DU7">Lemma <span data-tag="0DU7">101.45.1</span>.</a> Let $f : \mathcal{X} \to \mathcal{Y}$ be a morphism of algebraic stacks. If $\mathcal{I}_\mathcal {X} \to \mathcal{X} \times _\mathcal {Y} \mathcal{I}_\mathcal {Y}$ is an isomorphism, then $f$ is representable by algebraic spaces. </p>
